ogical superiority, the outsiders will eventually overwhelm your land and force you out. Lead your tribe to stand your ground and repel them away.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109110/extras/2d3e8a9d02a6f23848cc0f7384d44227.poster.avif?t=1724593259\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109110/extras/2d3e8a9d02a6f23848cc0f7384d44227.webm?t=1724593259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109110/extras/2d3e8a9d02a6f23848cc0f7384d44227.mp4?t=1724593259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
